siness_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"oCtDz1M-m-iYH1cG2o4mtA","review_id":"JSs9b6Yvh8-9kqbWDzEFNg","date":"2014-04-11T00:57:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9327490329742432,"text_excerpt":"This is one of the best food trucks in the city. The Poutine is my favorite. Whenever they have lemon squares, I buy half a dozen. The burger is delicious and the onions are nicely caramelized. Definitely give them a try! Check Facebook for location post. I generally find them at the rusty nail, 45 tchoup, or one of the round ups. They take credit cards."},{"business_id":"oCtDz1M-m-iYH1cG2o4mtA","review_id":"js_BdZnUw-PeFLqxUp2krw","date":"2015-09-14T15:54:56","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9323594570159912,"text_excerpt":"One of my favorite food trucks! Found them at The Rusty Nail on Saints opener game day. Wasn't famished but couldn't pass up a nibble from Foodie Call, got the Parmesan Garlic Truffle Fries....get these. I've had a number of things in the past that I enjoyed: Poutine, Burger, Brownie. If you see this truck and your stomach needs sustenance, stop and grab a bite!"},{"business_id":"oCtDz1M-m-iYH1cG2o4mtA","review_id":"pVSbJPQ4ED1hmDWM6tvWBQ","date":"2013-03-16T00:10:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9314470291137695,"text_excerpt":"At the recent food truck awards they were my winners. The poutine and Italian Ham sandwich were excellent. Can't wait to see them at future events around town."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
